Main Types of Computers

• Desktops: Stationary setups with separate screens and towers designed for desks.
• Laptops: Portable, all-in-one mobile computers.
• Servers: High-powered machines that manage networks, host websites, and store shared data.
• Supercomputers / Mainframes: Massive systems built for complex scientific calculations or enterprise-level data processing.
